/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 251 0 R
/T (The main objective of this project is to clean and preprocess payroll data to improve data accuracy and reliability. The project involves identifying and correcting errors, handling missing values, removing duplicate records, standardizing formats, and validating salary-related calculations using Excel tools and formulas.)
/E (The main objective of this project is to clean and preprocess payroll data to improve data accuracy and reliability. The project involves identifying and correcting errors, handling missing values, removing duplicate records, standardizing formats, and validating salary-related calculations using Excel tools and formulas.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
343 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 251 0 R
/T (After the cleaning process, financial analysis was performed using Excel formulas such as SUM, AVERAGE, IF, SUMIF, COUNTIF, and VLOOKUP along with Pivot Tables for department-wise salary analysis and payroll expense calculation. Various charts and dashboards were created to visualize employee salary distribution, bonus analysis, tax deductions, and department-wise payroll expenses.)
/E (After the cleaning process, financial analysis was performed using Excel formulas such as SUM, AVERAGE, IF, SUMIF, COUNTIF, and VLOOKUP along with Pivot Tables for department-wise salary analysis and payroll expense calculation. Various charts and dashboards were created to visualize employee salary distribution, bonus analysis, tax deductions, and department-wise payroll expenses.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
344 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 251 0 R
