/E (Additionally, Artificial Intelligence tools such as ChatGPT and Microsoft Copilot were integrated into the project to generate automated summaries, payroll insights, and recommendations. AI-generated narratives helped simplify data interpretation and improve reporting efficiency.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [7]
>>
