/T (Microsoft Excel Microsoft Excel is used for data cleaning, salary calculations, Pivot Tables, formulas, and financial analysis. It helps in removing duplicate records, correcting errors, handling missing values, and analysing payroll data efficiently. Microsoft Power BI Power BI is used for creating dashboards, charts, and visual reports. It helps in visualizing department-wise salary distribution, payroll expenses, and employee compensation trends. ChatGPT / Microsoft Copilot AI tools such as ChatGPT and Microsoft Copilot are used to generate summaries, payroll insights, and recommendations from the analysed data. These tools improve reporting efficiency and simplify data interpretation.)
/E (Microsoft Excel Microsoft Excel is used for data cleaning, salary calculations, Pivot Tables, formulas, and financial analysis. It helps in removing duplicate records, correcting errors, handling missing values, and analysing payroll data efficiently. Microsoft Power BI Power BI is used for creating dashboards, charts, and visual reports. It helps in visualizing department-wise salary distribution, payroll expenses, and employee compensation trends. ChatGPT / Microsoft Copilot AI tools such as ChatGPT and Microsoft Copilot are used to generate summaries, payroll insights, and recommendations from the analysed data. These tools improve reporting efficiency and simplify data interpretation.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
